        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "In response to associate feedback and rising healthcare costs, we redesigned medical benefits to better align with market practices by simplifying plan options, introducing a high-deductible plan with employer-funded Health Savings Account (“HSA”) contributions, conducting active enrollment to increase education and participation, and expanding family planning benefits to include infertility coverage and support.",
